  "releaseNotes": "2.6.0 - The platform release: .NET 10 + MonoGame 3.8.5; same engine as Cocos2D-Mono 2.6.0, without the content-pipeline build target. Migration: retarget your game to .NET 10 and bump the package reference.\n2.5.12 - Final bug-fix release of the 2.5 line; same engine fixes as Cocos2D-Mono 2.5.12.\n- See https://github.com/Cocos2D-Mono/cocos2d-mono for the full changelog.",
